-- Seed the 11 people and businesses the app links to (opportunity posters, applicants,
-- collab participants) as real, public profiles. Generated from src/data/linked-profiles.ts,
-- which also carries the sections the profiles table does not store.
--
-- Each needs an auth.users row because profiles.id references it. The users have no email and
-- no password, so nobody can sign in as them. on_auth_user_created creates a bare profile; the
-- upsert fills it. Idempotent: re-running changes nothing.
